📌 SaaS Registration & Automated Payment System

A fully automated SaaS-style system that handles user registration, payment processing, and onboarding using Google Forms, Razorpay, and Google Meet scheduling.

🚀 Overview

This system eliminates manual work by automating the entire flow:

User registers via website → Google Form
Backend fetches responses automatically
Payment link is sent
User completes payment via Razorpay
Payment is verified via webhook
System sends:
Confirmation email
Google Meet invite
